<codeline><highlight class="normal">the<sp/>SCI<sp/>and<sp/>to<sp/>send<sp/>information<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>SCI.<sp/>Characters<sp/>received</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">by<sp/>the<sp/>SCI<sp/>port<sp/>are<sp/>sent<sp/>back<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>host.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
